    {
      "id": "pduTag",
      "kind": "field",
      "as": "the PDU tag",
      "form": {
        "of": "run",
        "bits": 8
      },
      "about": [
        "RFC 3416 §3: context-specific, constructed — so 0xa0 through 0xa8 by operation.",
        "",
        "Carried as a value and not read as a fork, because nothing about the layout turns on it. A",
        "GetRequest and a GetResponse are the same seven fields in the same order; what differs is who",
        "sent it and whether the two error fields mean anything."
      ]
