      "about": "RFC 3416 §3's ObjectSyntax: the universal types SNMP admits, the APPLICATION types it defines, and the three context-specific exception markers."
    },
    {
      "id": "valueLen",
      "kind": "field",
      "as": "the value length",
      "form": {
        "of": "escaped",
        "limit": 128,
