      "form": {
        "of": "opaque"
      },
      "about": [
        "The octets, as they came. Not decoded, and that is the decision rather than the shortcut.",
        "",
        "A varbind's layout does not depend on its type: tag, length, that many octets, for every one of",
        "the thirteen SNMP admits and every one added since. What the octets mean does depend on it, and",
        "that lives in a MIB — the same place that says sysDescr.0 is a string and sysUpTime.0 is",
        "hundredths of a second since the agent started. Forking here would put a closed list of types",
        "in a description of a format that was designed for the list to grow."
